Vendored third-party single-header libraries — used ONLY by the dev tooling
(tools/vt_gif.c); not part of the timui.h library or its distributed header.

- stb_image.h, stb_image_write.h, stb_truetype.h, stb_image_resize2.h —
  Sean Barrett et al. Dual-licensed: public domain (Unlicense) OR MIT.
  https://github.com/nothings/stb

- msf_gif.h — Miles Fogle.
  Dual-licensed: MIT OR public domain (Unlicense).
  https://github.com/notnullnotvoid/msf_gif

- vt_font_ttf.h — a subset of DejaVu Sans Mono (Bitstream Vera Fonts + DejaVu
  license; freely redistributable), embedded as a byte array. Regenerate with
  `make gen-font-ttf` (tools/gen_font_ttf.py). vt_gif rasterizes it at runtime
  with stb_truetype.
